    "displayName": "Getting Our Goods Back",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "We’ve been using the old Hathor [Location1] and [Location2] as stashes, but it turns out some over-eager nullbrains sniffed them out and are trying to boost our shit for their own.\n\nLuckily, the goods are still there - for now. We need someone to visit that PAF and OLP, grab our stuff from the freight elevators, and take it to the freight elevator at [Destination] where we should be able to keep it on ice. \n\nHere’s the list of what to grab. Don’t care what order you do ‘em in. Be sure to bring a ship that can store [MissionMaxSCUSize] at the very least. \n\n[MultiToSingleToken]\n\nMake sure you’re ready to deal with whatever assholes you run across. A handheld tractor beam would also be smart to bring along. \n\nStows out.",
